        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengibona isithunywa simi elangeni, samemeza ngelizwi elikhulu ezinyonini zonke eziphaphayo emkhathini, sathi: Wozani, libuthane edilini elikhulu likaNkulunkulu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.39.17+EZK.39.18+EZK.39.19+EZK.39.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hez 39:17–20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukuba lidle inyama yamakhosi, lenyama yezinduna, lenyama yezikhulu, lenyama yamabhiza leyabagadi bawo, lenyama yabantu bonke abakhululekileyo labayizigqili, abancinyane labakhulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngabona isilo, lamakhosi omhlaba lezimpi zawo zibuthanele ukulwa laye ogade ibhiza kanye lezimpi zakhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isilo sasesibanjwa kanye lomprofethi wamanga owenza izibonakaliso phambi kwaso, aduhisa ngazo labo ababelophawu lwesilo lalabo abakhonza umfanekiso waso; isilo lomprofethi wamanga kwaphoselwa echibini lomlilo elivutha ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
